<p>If your business serves customers in a specific city or neighbourhood in Kenya, local SEO is the single highest-ROI marketing investment you can make. This guide will walk you through everything — from setting up your Google Business Profile to ranking at the top of Google Maps for searches like "best plumber in Westlands" or "hotel in Diani Beach".</p>

<h2>What is Local SEO and Why Does It Matter in Kenya?</h2>

<p>Local SEO is the process of optimising your online presence so that your business appears prominently when people search for products or services near them. In Kenya, smartphone penetration has exploded — over 60% of internet searches happen on mobile, and most of those searches have local intent.</p>

<p>When someone types "digital marketing agency Nairobi" or "restaurant near me" into Google, the results they see are determined by three local ranking factors: <strong>relevance</strong>, <strong>distance</strong> and <strong>prominence</strong>. Your job is to optimise all three.</p>

